        print("  Section 5: Name a specific role for annual review.")
        print("  'The bank' or 'the team' is not accountable enough.")
        print("  'Chief Data Officer' or 'AI Governance Committee'")
        print("  creates a clear line of accountability.")
        print()
    if not threshold_ok:
        print("  Section 5: Add a specific measurable trigger.")
        print("  'If performance drops' is vague. A regulator needs")
        print("  a number: 'if recommendation acceptance rate falls")
        print("  below 12%' or 'if demographic gap exceeds 5pp'.")
        print()
    if passed >= 7:
        print("  Strong governance card. Move to Task 3.")

